"save.blocked" = "%@\n\nCopy your data somewhere safe before deciding: open the Files app → “On My iPhone” (“On My iPad” on iPad) → “%@”, and copy the whole “S2A” folder somewhere else. Unfinished operations are recorded in S2A/save-transfer/save-transactions. You can also select this device in Finder on a Mac → “Files”, and drag out the “S2A” folder under this app.\n\nAfter copying, you can repackage and install to try again, or tap “Start game anyway…”.";
