"save.location" = "Save location: open the Files app → On My iPhone (On My iPad on iPad) → %@ → %@\n\nPut a save folder in its original format there (exported from a console, JKSV / Checkpoint and similar tools, or copied from the same game's SaveData on your computer) and the game uses it the next time you start. When you quit, it's updated with your latest progress; copy the whole folder to the same place on your computer or another device to keep playing.\n\nCopying from a computer: on a Mac, select this device in the Finder sidebar → Files, drag the folder onto \"%@\", then use the Files app to move it into the location above.";
