"settings.footer.dev" = "Takes effect next launch.\nS2Arm overlay: shows the target frame rate, slow-frame ratio, graphics mode, first-use compilation, audio status and build ID.\nMetal performance HUD: shows the frame rate, GPU time and a frame-interval graph. For manual viewing on development devices only; while it’s on, screenshots, frame capture, autoplay and full-screen checks aren’t used.";
