"settings.footer.graphics" = "Takes effect after restarting the game. While a game is running, you can choose to restart right away when you tap Done; save in the game first.\nDocked mode is how the Switch runs in its dock; when off, Handheld mode is used. The actual resolution and quality are up to the game; this is set separately from the compatible / high-performance run mode.\nWidescreen and 60 FPS need resource pack support and may increase load and power use.";
